      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Trumann evolved from agricultural roots into a vibrant community, thanks to its ties to Arkansas’s farming and timber industries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.storeitquick.com/discover-trumann-ar",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Trumann sits in the Arkansas Delta’s Francis Lowlands, a flat region with fertile soil shaped by the 1811–12 New Madrid earthquakes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
